{"name":"Butter Cupcake","hex":"#ffdd99","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"butter","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A soft, fatty foodstuff made by churning the cream of milk (generally cow's milk).","Any of various foodstuffs made from other foods or oils, similar in consistency to, eaten like or intended as a substitute for butter (preceded by the name of the food used to make it)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To spread butter on.","To move one's weight backwards or forwards onto the tips or tails of one's skis or snowboard so only the tip or tail is in contact with the snow. Similar to applying butter to bread with the end of a knife.\nTo spin on skis or a snowboard using only the tips or tails being in contact with the snow"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/butter"},{"term":"cupcake","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small cake baked in a usually paper container shaped like a cup, often with icing on top.","An attractive young woman."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To flirt; to talk or act amorously or intimately.","To flirt with; to talk or act amorously or intimately to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cupcake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Butter","blocks":[{"text":"Butter is a dairy product made from the fat and protein components of churned cream. It is a semi-solid emulsion at room temperature, consisting of approximately 81% butterfat. It is used at room temperature as a spread, melted as a condiment, and used as a fat in baking, sauce-making, pan frying, and other cooking procedures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/%C5%A0v%C3%A9dsk%C3%BD_kol%C3%A1%C4%8D_naruby_904_%28cropped%29.JPG/330px-%C5%A0v%C3%A9dsk%C3%BD_kol%C3%A1%C4%8D_naruby_904_%28cropped%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butter","wikidata":"Q34172"},{"title":"Cupcake","blocks":[{"text":"A cupcake, fairy cake (BrE), patty cake (AuE), or bun (IrE) is a small cake designed to serve one person, which may be baked in a small thin paper or aluminum cup. As with larger cakes, frosting, icing and various other cake decorations such as fruit and candy may be applied."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg/330px-Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cupcake","wikidata":"Q816851"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Buttered_crumpet3.jpg/500px-Buttered_crumpet3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Buttered_crumpet3.jpg/1280px-Buttered_crumpet3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Buttered_crumpet3.jpg/500px-Buttered_crumpet3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Butter spread on a crumpet using a butter knife","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AButtered_crumpet3.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Churning_butter.jpg/500px-Churning_butter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Churning_butter.jpg/1280px-Churning_butter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Churning_butter.jpg/500px-Churning_butter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Churning cream into butter using a hand-held mixer","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChurning_butter.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo